## Rebase / FS / environment contract

Known historical A/snap→CODE_DIR, A/home→HOME, A/ws→WS, alias-home→HOME_ALIAS substitutions use explicit `@@NAME@@` tokens (not Python format/eval). Literal `$HOME`, `${HOME}`, shell quotes/backslashes remain literal command text for the real scanner; no controller shell interpolation. Paths inside command strings are never passed to a real shell. Runnable rows naming live `/com.termux/files/home/` are refused by adapter preflight; invalid NV32 is skipped before rendering. System executable paths remain classifier strings/metadata; guard refuses any process attempt.

Controller validates supplied archive snapshot against complete per-file hash manifest and40hex committed rev; rejects source within live repo/ancestor and every source symlink/non-file. Copies only into fresh validated nonce HOME/Codey-OS, verifies copy hashes. No cleanup/rmtree. Own HOME/state/audit/config/DB/temp/PREFIX/Git config, absolute Python executable/system-only PATH; no inherited credentials/proxies/CODEY overrides. Dummy ws/ls and shadowbin/cat files live below root (not symlinks to real binaries); only symlinks target fake credential, fake bashrc and copied main.py inside root.

Target installs reviewed guard BEFORE tools.shell_tools/core.task_executor imports; checks loaded product __file__ paths under copied source, config/state/log/checkpoint/runtime roots under nonce; confirms all primitive identities after imports and before/after every case. Any primitive during imports aborts before probes and saves evidence. Config sets confirm_shell/writeFalse for intended confirm-less profile; no primitive recorder is overwritten, no real API saved/restored, no network/loopback exception. PATH changes only for NV27 shadow scenario and restores that owned env value afterwards.

